        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Made a 500$ deposit which I still didn’t receive back almost a month later. Came in person to solve the issue, but no one was there. A sign saying « will be back in 15 minutes » was hanging, so I decided to wait. Half an hour later - still no one. What a half ass business. Avoid at all cost.",
