        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV0fwIp3tEJzQO4q9XTXVMBYyNPkqKigr_b_HiQ7HscYoYdvygW=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Excellent service, purchase of a Box truck was done flawlessly and Benoit Gagnon made it all possible. Great Five Star service.",
        "time": 1706204944,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Amine Elbak",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109249831983991353793/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLyj7aZZw9PoFSs3rzUN3rKXezXGmLThjTJLSLg_JBijyi3Uw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "I bought a straight truck certified oct2019 , supposed to be in working condition , The truck was delivered with new inspection saaq . Took it to a prehire inspection they found a lot of problems , thats all happened in 1 day from delivery . The Ryder sales mng cant do nothing about it i had to deal with warranty departement in usa i am still waiting for a call 1 week now and no answear yet . I have been calling every day since . I will never ever buy from Ryder",
        "time": 1571935504,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "pierre sylvestre",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106385756865578770522/reviews",
