        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIl3szDLqjLW4jjLlzopSY2hVAoNfcn8RqjImn8A7Y6_h8YTQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "inspection donne and many faults not fixed or just ignored terrible and all they say is we followed government guidelines . My God i had a check engine light on picking up the vehicle that wasn't there when i test drove it ' brakes where almost finished tires , terrible , and they kept saying  cost me several thousands of dollars . You want to save problems look elsewhere you will save a lot of grief 'time and money .",
